  "bodyHash": "l9/Rt2Lxv1A=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOQL2ro.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit Mod\" width=\"1372\" height=\"1001\">\n    </a>\n  </span>\n  &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">\n    <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">\n    <strong>📖 關於 📖</strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Snowy Spirit 是一個冬季主題的模組，增加了許多裝飾方塊與功能！此模組高度可配置，所有方塊與物品都可調整或停用。其主要特色如下：</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">\n    <span>\n      <iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6lPE3bSGgok?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe>\n    </span>\n    <br>此專案於 2021 年冬季創作挑戰賽中完成\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:14px\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>🛷 雪橇 🛷<br></strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 雪橇是一種在雪地上移動的新方式。與船不同，它們會沿著地形彎曲行進，使其能夠平穩地上下坡。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 下坡時還會進一步加速，讓滑雪路線成為可能。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 雪橇在冰上具有更高的機動性，在雪上滑行時仍可操控方向，甚至可將雪橇旋轉 90 度完全停下，就像現實中一樣！</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 可以在雪橇上放置儲物箱以增加物品空間。也可使用界伏盒與 Supplementaries 模組的袋子。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 也可以用牽繩將已馴服的狼綁在雪橇上。狼拉雪橇時會提升機動性與速度，並能以最小減速爬上坡。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 冰屋現在有機會生成附帶儲物箱雪橇，裡面可能裝有冬季寶物。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 可在雪橇上放置地毯進行自訂，同時可防止在冰冷的積雪上滑行時凍傷。</span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>☃️ 村民 AI ☃️</strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 冬季期間，村民偶爾會在門上放置聖誕花圈。每個村民只能放一個，別擔心，冬天結束後他們會自行清理。放置花圈的行為會在空閒時間（例如大約 0 刻度）發生。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 若安裝了 Supplementaries 模組，村民還會放置裝有酷炫物品的禮物方塊。每個村民只能在聚會時間（9000 刻度後）於聚會點附近放置一個禮物。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 針葉林與凍原的幼年村民會在遊玩時間向看到的任何實體丟雪球。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 「冬季時間」是可透過設定檔調整的時段，預設為 12 月 20 日至 1 月 30 日。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 若安裝了 Serene Seasons 模組，也可讓此模組跟隨其季節變化。</span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>🎁 全新方塊 🎁<br></strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 生薑：一種新農作物，可製作成裝飾方塊「薑餅方塊」。野生生薑可在稀疏叢林生態域中找到。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 軟糖：有各種顏色，可被實體推動，作用類似按鈕與壓力板的混合體，且適用於所有方向。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 拐杖糖：外觀甜美的物品（字面上），可製成裝飾用拐杖糖方塊。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 聖誕花圈：可掛在門上，為房屋增添聖誕氣氛。也支援所有模組的門。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 螢光燈：可放置在任何樹葉上，使其在黑暗中發光。可用剪刀移除或直接破壞。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 雪球：一個方塊，放置在下雪的地方時會變成雪景狀態。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 新唱片：新增了一張冬季主題唱片，可在禮物與冰屋雪橇儲物箱中低機率找到。</span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>🍪 薑餅人魔像 🍪</strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 將南瓜放在薑餅方塊上，並在身體上加上軟糖按鈕，即可創造薑餅人魔像。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 這些有趣的小生物會像寵物一樣跟隨主人，但不會傳送。可用蹲下右鍵指令其坐下。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 空腹時右鍵點擊牠們，就可以咬一口！畢竟牠們就是會走路的餅乾。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 可以用其他薑餅餅乾餵食，修復牠們的四肢。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 但別餵牛奶！水也會傷害牠們。</span>\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> • 有 16 種顏色，每種對應不同個性。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">• 薑餅屋是生成在雪地生態域的新結構，裡面住著女巫，功能類似雪地女巫小屋。薑餅人魔像也會在此自然生成。</span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:14px\">\n    <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組開發耗費我大量時間，如果你喜歡我的作品並想支持我，可以在這裡贊助。贊助後你將獲得專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！若使用代碼「supplementaries」從 Akliz 購買伺服器，也同樣適用。</span>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <br>\n    <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <br>\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？試試 Akliz，他們專為模組 Minecraft 提供頂級伺服器。</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有溫馨的社群、出色的支援，且伺服器表現優異。<br>使用代碼「supplementaries」可享<strong>8 折優惠</strong>，同時也支持我的創作！</span>\n  <br>\n  <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n      <strong>🏆 特別感謝 🏆</strong>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">DemiMark 提供雪橇音效</span></li>\n    <li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">SophieTheTrophy 提供薑餅方塊音效</span></li>\n  </ul>\n  <span style=\"font-size:14px\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T6Am707.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\">\n  </span>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px\">\n    <strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:18px\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https:/